# Bubblewrap compares a SHA-1 of twa-manifest.json with manifest-checksum.txt before every build; a CRLF checkout
# (core.autocrlf) would change the bytes, and `bubblewrap build` would then prompt to regenerate and bump the version.
twa-manifest.json -text
manifest-checksum.txt -text
gradlew text eol=lf
